rrent management plan with apremilast 30 mg was effective. Blood pressure was 140/88, and she weighed 164 lbs.\n\nOn July 7, 2022, Ms. Erickson was seen for her psoriasis and psoriatic arthritis. She reported that her condition was well-controlled. Blood pressure at this visit was 143/91, and her weight was 173 lbs.\n\nAssessment and Plan:\nDonna Erickson has been diagnosed with psoriasis and psoriatic arthritis, which are currently controlled with apremilast 30 mg. Her skin and joint symptoms are stable, and she reports no significant flares. Vital signs have been monitored at each visit, wit"
